<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verify Your Email Address</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 32px 16px; background-color: #111827; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #e5e7eb;">
<div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px; background-color: #1f2937; border: 1px solid #374151; border-radius: 12px;">

    <h1 style="margin-top: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 26px;">
        Welcome to FoxFire's Website!
    </h1>

    <p style="line-height: 1.7;">
        Thank you for creating an account.
    </p>

    <p style="line-height: 1.7;">
        Before you can sign in, please verify your email address by clicking the button below.
    </p>

    <p style="margin: 32px 0; text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{ signedUrl|raw }}"
           style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 28px; background-color: #dc2626; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px;">
            Verify Email Address
        </a>
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.6;">
        This verification link will expire in
        {{ expiresAtMessageKey|trans(expiresAtMessageData, 'VerifyEmailBundle') }}.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.6;">
        If you didn't create an account on FoxFire's Website, you can safely ignore this email.
    </p>

    <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #374151; margin: 28px 0;">

    <p style="margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #9ca3af;">
        See you around! 🦊<br>
        FoxFire
    </p>

</div>
</body>
</html>
